hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"244","Idhā ra’a aḥadukum min akhīhi, aw min nafsihi, aw min mālihi mā yu‘jibuhu [fal-yad‘u lahu bi’l-baraka] fa’inna al-‘ayna ḥaqq.. When one of you sees something that pleases him in his brother, in himself, or in his wealth, let him invoke blessings upon him, for indeed the evil eye is real."
"245","Lā ilāha illallāh! There is none worthy of worship but Allah! Reference: Al-Bukhari, cf. Al-Asqalani, Fathul-Bari 6/181, Muslim 4/2208."
